# AEM 6.5.24 On-Premise Standards

## Project Configuration

- **AEM Version:** 6.5.24 (on-premise)
- **Java Version:** 11
- **Build Tool:** Maven (aem-project-archetype)
- **Critical:** Never use deprecated APIs or methods

## Deprecated Code Prevention

### Sling Models

```java
// ❌ DEPRECATED - Do not use @Model with adaptables array
@Model(adaptables = {Resource.class, SlingHttpServletRequest.class})

// ✅ GOOD - Use single adaptable
@Model(adaptables = Resource.class)
```

### Resource Resolver

```java
// ❌ DEPRECATED - Do not use administrative ResourceResolver
resourceResolverFactory.getAdministrativeResourceResolver(null);

// ✅ GOOD - Use service user with proper mapping
Map<String, Object> param = new HashMap<>();
param.put(ResourceResolverFactory.SUBSERVICE, "myServiceUser");
resourceResolverFactory.getServiceResourceResolver(param);
```

### JCR Session

```java
// ❌ DEPRECATED - Do not use Session.save()
session.save();

// ✅ GOOD - Use Resource API
resourceResolver.commit();
```

### Component Context

```java
// ❌ DEPRECATED - Do not use ComponentContext
ComponentContext componentContext = WCMUtils.getComponentContext(request);

// ✅ GOOD - Use modern Sling Models and resource resolution
@Model(adaptables = SlingHttpServletRequest.class)
```

## Java 11 Best Practices

- Use `var` for local variable type inference when type is obvious
- Prefer `List.of()`, `Set.of()`, `Map.of()` for immutable collections
- Use `String.isBlank()`, `String.lines()`, `String.strip()` for string operations
- Leverage `Optional.isEmpty()` instead of `!isPresent()`

## HTL Standards

```html
<!-- ✅ Use data-sly-use with full class path -->
<div data-sly-use.model="com.fa.core.models.BreadcrumbModel">
    ${model.title}
</div>

<!-- ❌ Avoid deprecated HTL global objects -->
<!-- Do not use: pageProperties, inheritedPageProperties (use model instead) -->
```

## OSGi Services

```java
// ✅ Use OSGi R7 annotations
@Component(service = MyService.class)
@Designate(ocd = MyService.Config.class)
public class MyServiceImpl implements MyService {
    
    @ObjectClassDefinition(name = "My Service Configuration")
    public @interface Config {
        @AttributeDefinition(name = "Property")
        String property() default "value";
    }
}

// ❌ Do not use Felix SCR annotations (@Reference, @Component from org.apache.felix.scr)
```

## Query Best Practices

```java
// ✅ Use QueryBuilder for safe queries
QueryBuilder queryBuilder = resourceResolver.adaptTo(QueryBuilder.class);
Map<String, String> predicates = new HashMap<>();
predicates.put("path", "/content/newspaper");
predicates.put("type", "cq:Page");
Query query = queryBuilder.createQuery(PredicateGroup.create(predicates), session);

// ❌ Avoid raw JCR-SQL2 without proper escaping
```

## Maven Dependencies

- Always specify dependency versions explicitly
- Use `<dependencyManagement>` in parent POM
- Exclude transitive dependencies that bring deprecated APIs
- Verify compatibility with AEM 6.5.24 and Java 11
